.nh
.TH "PB-ACCOUNT-DELETE" "1" "Sep 2026" "Paperboat" "Paperboat CLI"

.SH NAME
pb-account-delete - Show where to delete your Paperboat account


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpb account delete [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Deleting your Paperboat account removes your machines, sessions and data and cannot be undone. It is done in the Paperboat console, where you confirm it with your email; pb prints the link.

.PP
JSON output is supported with --json.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for delete

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	print JSON


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--config\fP=""
	path to the CLI config file

.PP
\fB--no-customization\fP[=false]
	ignore local shortcuts, command defaults, and TUI preferences

.PP
\fB--server\fP=""
	paperboat-server base URL override

.PP
\fB--workspace\fP=""
	resource workspace selector: personal or a team slug


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBpb-account(1)\fP
